<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.10);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            border-radius: 14px;
            border: 1px solid #ffffff;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #083122 0%, #035335 50%, #083122 100%);
            box-shadow: -1px 4px 24px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.24);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px 0 16px 0;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 160px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            height: auto;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 32px 24px 24px 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .title {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111827;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 14px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .coupon-box {
            border: 1px dashed #2e8b57;
            background-color: #ecfdf5;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 16px;
            margin: 18px 0 20px;
        }

        .coupon-label {
            margin: 0 0 6px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 13px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .coupon-code {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: "Courier New", monospace;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #2e8b57;
        }

        .coupon-note {
            margin-top: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #374151;
        }

        .cta-wrapper {
            margin: 24px 0 20px;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2e8b57 0%, #3cb371 100%);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f2f6f9;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 24px 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e6ed;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #2e8b57;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            .email-container {
                margin: 10px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}">
                <img src="{{host}}/public/images/logo.png" alt="VapeHub Logo" class="logo" />
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h1 class="title">A friendly reminder + 10% off</h1>
            <p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
            <p>Your checkout is still pending, so we saved a one-time 10% discount code for you.</p>

            <div class="coupon-box">
                <p class="coupon-label">Your code</p>
                <p class="coupon-code">{{discountCode}}</p>
                <p class="coupon-note">Copy and apply this code at checkout. Valid for 48 hours and one-time use.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="cta-wrapper">
                <a class="cta-button" href="{{ctaUrl}}">Complete Your Purchase</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Need help with your order? Our customer service team is here to assist you.</p>
            <div style="margin-top: 15px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
                <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Customer Services</p>
                <p>Email us: <a href="mailto:customerservices@vapehub.co.uk">customerservices@vapehub.co.uk</a></p>
                <p>Call us: <a href="tel:07508373773">07508 373773</a></p>
            </div>
            <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} VapeHub. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
